abstract: >-
  RoninForge ai-price-index-mcp is a read-only Model Context Protocol server
  that answers what an AI model's API price was on a given date, returning the
  first-party source URL and the date that price was last validated so an agent
  can cite the number. It serves the open AI Price Index dataset, is MIT
  licensed, runs entirely on your machine, and requires no API keys.
